 Check states distinguish not checked, checking, metadata update, up to date and failed. Never call persisted data latest without a successful check. Repository sequence is an update number, while a Manifest has a SemVer version. Published 2.0.0 with imported/active 1.0.0 offers Add Update. Imported 2.0.0 with active 1.0.0 offers Enable 2.0.0; import leaves 1.0.0 active, while explicit enable and OK atomically replace it. No separate Approve action.
 
